      "raw": "I haven't tried the HP counters, yet (I usually use dice, so I'm not sure if I will), but I have a lot of smaller counters I've used in the past for similar sheets that worked great. You can usually find them for cheap at places like Joanne's or Michael's - hobby stores will have them far cheaper than gaming stores. Those I use are fairly transparent, so you can see the number beneath, but even if you can't you can tell what it is by those beside it. \n\nRabit",
