      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-03-14T17:20:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My glass beads are larger than the numbers, but they tend to magnify; even though they cover the numbers above and below, only the one number is seen through the bead.</p>",
